        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "test(cli): add unit tests for CLI argument quoting helper",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe `quoteCliArg` function safely quotes CLI arguments when they contain special characters. Without tests, the quoting logic could silently regress.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nAdd unit tests covering safe strings, spaces, single quotes, special characters, and empty strings.\n\n## User Impact\n\nCLI argument quoting now has comprehensive test coverage, reducing regression risk.\n\n## Evidence\n\nDirect behavior probe with real function calls:\n\n```text\n$ node --import tsx -e \"import('./src/cli/quote-cli-arg.js').then(({quoteCliArg})=>console.log(JSON.stringify([{i:'hello',r:quoteCliArg('hello'),e:'hello'},{i:'hello world',r:quoteCliArg('hello world'),e:'\\'hello world\\''},{i:\"it's\",r:quoteCliArg(\"it's\"),e:\"'it'\\\\''s'\"}])))\"\n[{\"i\":\"hello\",\"r\":\"hello\",\"e\":\"hello\"},{\"i\":\"hello world\",\"r\":\"'hello world'\",\"e\":\"'hello world'\"},{\"i\":\"it's\",\"r\":\"'it'\\\\''s'\",\"e\":\"'it'\\\\''s'\"}]\n```\n\nTargeted test:\n\n```text\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/cli/quote-cli-arg.test.ts\n\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\n     Tests  6 passed (6)\n  Duration  331ms\n```\n\nFormatting:\n\n```text\n$ npx oxfmt --check src/cli/quote-cli-arg.ts src/cli/quote-cli-arg.test.ts\nChecking formatting...\n\nAll matched files use the correct format.\nFinished in 87ms on 2 files using 8 threads.\n```\n\nWhitespace:\n\n```text\n$ git diff --check\n```",
